(6985825, 1054885, 100495, '<td valign="top">Good points: Love the idea and the depth of the black background.<br/> <br/>Less-good points: The composition is a little centred for me; I think the strawberry would be best placed on the left of the crop with a long spoon accentuating it. More sugar would have enhanced the ''waterfall'' effect.</td>', 'Good points: Love the idea and the depth of the black background. Less-good points: The composition is a little centred for me; I think the strawberry would be best placed on the left of the crop with a long spoon accentuating it. More sugar would have enhanced the ''waterfall'' effect.', '2013-02-25 09:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6985826, 1054525, 100495, '<td valign="top">Toga! Toga! Toga! Toga!<br/> <br/>Great fun feel; possibly lose some of the top of the shot.<br/> <br/>Would have been great for the ''self-portrait in a crowd'' challenge too.</td>', 'Toga! Toga! Toga! Toga! Great fun feel; possibly lose some of the top of the shot. Would have been great for the ''self-portrait in a crowd'' challenge too.', '2013-02-25 09:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
