(6985970, 1054947, 64989, '<td valign="top">I do not want to imagine how many frames it must have taken to get this just right!  Your patience was well worth the effort. Nice.</td>', 'I do not want to imagine how many frames it must have taken to get this just right!  Your patience was well worth the effort. Nice.', '2013-02-25 14:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
