(6990683, 1054761, 113591, '<td valign="top">Your entry is the better one. Nothing wrong with it, but you know you won''t convince the average DPC''er of it''s merit. Way too little impact/colour.<br/> <br/>I like the opening up of the staircase to the right, and that the body is walking into his own darkness, and that you cropped it into flowing lines, forming a big C. <br/> <br/>It seems as if he is walking down, because of the darkness in front of him, and his bowed head.</td>', 'Your entry is the better one. Nothing wrong with it, but you know you won''t convince the average DPC''er of it''s merit. Way too little impact/colour. I like the opening up of the staircase to the right, and that the body is walking into his own darkness, and that you cropped it into flowing lines, forming a big C.  It seems as if he is walking down, because of the darkness in front of him, and his bowed head.', '2013-03-04 02:03:43.000000', NULL, 0),
