(6990907, 1054827, 61961, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, and so nice to see a "pure" abstract in the top ten.</td>', 'Beautiful, and so nice to see a "pure" abstract in the top ten.', '2013-03-04 11:41:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6990909, 1054949, 49954, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> Degree difficulty very low. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Wow... glad you were there to know this.<br/> <br/>1. Camera mounted to tripod ballhead.<br/>2. Ballhead mounted on Monopod.<br/>3. 8mm Fisheye Lens attached.<br/>4. Wife driving car at normal speed as we take our dogs to park.<br/>5. Set timer mode.<br/>6. Press shutter.<br/>7. Photographer risking his camera extending the whole thing out the window, away from the car, fighting wind resistance.<br/>8. Repeating several times and angles to get a good shot that didn''t show camera and monopod shadow on car.<br/>9. Annoyed wife by embarrassing her to no end to oncoming motorists.<br/> <br/>Yes. Very very low difficulty.<br/> <br/>Kinda like shooting a non-moving landscape or a bucking ram from the safety of your megazoom lens.</td>', 'Originally posted by hahn23: Degree difficulty very low.   Wow... glad you were there to know this. 1. Camera mounted to tripod ballhead.2. Ballhead mounted on Monopod.3. 8mm Fisheye Lens attached.4. Wife driving car at normal speed as we take our dogs to park.5. Set timer mode.6. Press shutter.7. Photographer risking his camera extending the whole thing out the window, away from the car, fighting wind resistance.8. Repeating several times and angles to get a good shot that didn''t show camera and monopod shadow on car.9. Annoyed wife by embarrassing her to no end to oncoming motorists. Yes. Very very low difficulty. Kinda like shooting a non-moving landscape or a bucking ram from the safety of your megazoom lens.', '2013-03-04 11:43:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6990912, 1054537, 49954, '<td valign="top">Degree difficulty very low.<br/> <br/>eta: not that the ease of this shot (sitting on your behind with a long lens and waiting) should have anything at all to do with the score.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-03-04 12:25:39.</i></td>', 'Degree difficulty very low. eta: not that the ease of this shot (sitting on your behind with a long lens and waiting) should have anything at all to do with the score.', '2013-03-04 11:44:26.000000', '2013-03-04 12:25:39.000000', 0),
(6990913, 1054766, 61396, '<td valign="top">Interesting voting on this one. Certainly unexpected. I see some resemblance to one of my own lowest ranking images:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=742757" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/958/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_742757.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/958/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_742757.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/958/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_742757.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Interesting voting on this one. Certainly unexpected. I see some resemblance to one of my own lowest ranking images:', '2013-03-04 11:44:28.000000', NULL, 0),
