(6992378, 1054825, 60862, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this score (and I don''t say that very often on DPC).  This is very special!<br/> <br/>Came back to edit to add a few details about *why* it''s special: you captured important, relevant detail to the story while losing low-level background detail.  If this were a painting rather than a case where the timing was just right, I can''t imagine doing anything different.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-03-05 20:07:02.</i></td>', 'I can''t believe this score (and I don''t say that very often on DPC).  This is very special! Came back to edit to add a few details about *why* it''s special: you captured important, relevant detail to the story while losing low-level background detail.  If this were a painting rather than a case where the timing was just right, I can''t imagine doing anything different.', '2013-03-05 20:05:11.000000', '2013-03-05 20:07:02.000000', 0),
